          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E malaika pa Yehova wok woko, man egoyo dhanu rubanga dak acel ku pier abora wi abic i kagonjo mi Juascuri; man kinde ma dhanu ai pir kugweno, nen, maeni ceke gin avu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Senakerib m’ubimo mir Ascur uai, e ecidho edok, man ebedo i Nineve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde m’eberwo i ot pa Nisrok ma mungu pare, nia Adramelek ku Carezer ma wote gigoye ku palamularu; e giringo i ng’om Ararat. Man Esarhadon ma wode camu ker kakare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.38"
            ]
          }
        }
